---
import { content, href, type Locale } from '../data/content';
import CTA from './CTA.astro';
const { lang } = Astro.props as { lang: Locale };
const { t, stages } = content(lang);
---

<section class="wrap page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">ERYNDEX SERVICES / PROFESSIONAL SERVICES</p><h1>
    {t('產品的下一步，\n是你的企業。', 'Good software.\nMade right for your business.')}
  </h1><p class="lead">
    {
      t(
        '軟體只是開始。我們協助把產品放進真實環境，陪團隊建立可持續的使用方式。',
        'Software is just the beginning. We help introduce products into real environments and build practices your team can sustain.',
      )
    }
  </p><a class="button" href={href(lang, 'contact') + '?product=services'}
    >{t('討論服務需求', 'Discuss your needs')} ↗</a
  >
</section>
<section class="wrap service-timeline">
  {
    stages.map((s, i) => (
      <article>
        <>
          <span class="service-number">0{i + 1}</span>
          <div>
            <>
              <p class="eyebrow">{['INTRODUCE', 'ADAPT', 'CONTINUE'][i]}</p>
              <h2>{s.title}</h2>
              <p class="lead">{s.desc}</p>
            </>
          </div>
          <div>
            <>
              <ul>
                {s.items.map((item) => (
                  <li>{item}</li>
                ))}
              </ul>
              <p class="deliverable">
                {t('一起完成', 'What we work toward')}
                <br />
                {s.deliver}
              </p>
            </>
          </div>
        </>
      </article>
    ))
  }
</section>
<section class="wrap section service-boundary">
  <p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE, PRACTICE & CONTINUITY</p><h2>
    {
      t(
        '產品提供能力，\n服務讓能力真正用得上。',
        'Products create capability.\nServices put it into practice.',
      )
    }
  </h2><div>
    <p class="lead">
      {
        t(
          '例如，Files 的版本還原是一項產品功能；協助企業搬遷既有資料、規劃保存原則並完成還原演練，則屬於專業服務。兩者分工清楚，才能讓期待一致。',
          'For example, version restore is a Files capability. Migrating existing information, planning retention and practicing recovery are professional services. Clear responsibilities create shared expectations.',
        )
      }
    </p><p>
      {
        t(
          '導入範圍、時程、支援方式與費用，會依實際需求另行確認。',
          'Implementation scope, timing, support arrangements and fees are agreed around your actual needs.',
        )
      }
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<CTA lang={lang} />
